{"id":"n31953-4-2","stage":1,"title":"그것 · 那家伙","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31953-4-2-1","ko":"그것들 참 귀엽게 생겼네.","zh":"这些小家伙长得真可爱。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그것들","meaning":"那家伙，那小子","explanation":"그것：那家伙，那小子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"그것","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31953","senseId":"4","lemma":"그것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그것들","audio":"/audio/6dfe11cdf0e55948e910.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"귀엽게","meaning":"可爱","explanation":"귀엽다：可爱；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"귀엽다","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38323","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀엽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"귀엽게","audio":"/audio/7c9dfa6e73c09f2d1897.mp3"}},{"text":"생겼네.","meaning":"长","explanation":"생기다：长；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"4","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생겼네","audio":"/audio/29a9abf3f4a74bd10c87.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"49ef044188dcd25e","term":"그것","zh":"那家伙，那小子","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3","entryId":"31953","definition":"(昵称)那个孩子。","pronunciation":["그걷"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"f6866c147cb407d9","term":"귀엽다","zh":"可爱","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3","entryId":"38323","definition":"看起来漂亮，或令人喜爱。","pronunciation":["귀ː엽따"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"长","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"人或事物的长相成为某种样子。","pronunciation":["생기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6a6bcf5b9c2faa7d9033.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31953-4-2-2","ko":"그러게 말이에요. 집에 돌아가면 손자들이 눈에 밟히겠어요.","zh":"是啊，回家以后一定会总惦记着孙辈们。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}},{"text":"말이에요.","meaning":"是啊、可不是嘛（그러게 말이에요）","explanation":"말：是啊、可不是嘛（그러게 말이에요）；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"11","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이에요","audio":"/audio/eb49aaa0268bb74f5d29.mp3"}},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"돌아가면","meaning":"返回","explanation":"돌아가다：返回；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"돌아가다","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74103","senseId":"8","lemma":"돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌아가면","audio":"/audio/9f85e4461ab1bdf895f2.mp3"}},{"text":"손자들이","meaning":"孙子，外孙","explanation":"손자：孙子，外孙；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"손자","audio":"/audio/663ded26798b941a6332.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63880","senseId":"1","lemma":"손자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손자들이","audio":"/audio/ebabbed3a7a76df81759.mp3"}},{"text":"눈에","meaning":"眼前（눈에 밟히다：总惦记、放心不下）","explanation":"눈：眼前（눈에 밟히다：总惦记、放心不下）；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈에","audio":"/audio/07026b7029c6aacdf449.mp3"}},{"text":"밟히겠어요.","meaning":"浮现在眼前、惦念（눈에 밟히다 的惯用表达）","explanation":"밟히다：浮现在眼前、惦念（눈에 밟히다 的惯用表达）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"밟히다","audio":"/audio/0558b818c5da21141baf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57998","senseId":"1","lemma":"밟히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밟히겠어요","audio":"/audio/19051733dc46ef6a7bdc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"是啊、可不是嘛（그러게 말이에요）","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"是啊、可不是嘛（그러게 말이에요）","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"1152d7a56fb1600a","term":"돌아가다","zh":"返回","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3","entryId":"74103","definition":"回到原来所在的地方或重新成为原来的状态。","pronunciation":["도라가다"]},{"id":"663ded26798b941a","term":"손자","zh":"孙子，外孙","audio":"/audio/663ded26798b941a6332.mp3","entryId":"63880","definition":"儿子的儿子；或指女儿的儿子。","pronunciation":["손자"]},{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"眼前（눈에 밟히다：总惦记、放心不下）","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"72704","definition":"眼前（눈에 밟히다：总惦记、放心不下）","pronunciation":["눈"]},{"id":"0558b818c5da2114","term":"밟히다","zh":"浮现在眼前、惦念（눈에 밟히다 的惯用表达）","audio":"/audio/0558b818c5da21141baf.mp3","entryId":"57998","definition":"浮现在眼前、惦念（눈에 밟히다 的惯用表达）","pronunciation":["발피다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7d9920d3ba085048ef4e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.582,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31953","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"초급","day":43,"sequenceScore":1.905,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这些小家伙长得真可爱。","这些小家伙长得可真高。","这些小家伙以前长得真可爱。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是啊，回家以后马上就会忘了孙辈们。","是啊，回家以后一定会总惦记着孙辈们。","是啊，孙辈们已经一起回家了。"],"answer":1}]}
